      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Exit the door to become small \u2014 climb the ladder and drop from
    skylight \u2014 push the yellow book on the shelf \u2014 exit and come back in
    from the door with medium size  \u2014 walk through the book bridge to access
    the right door \u2014 exit to become bigger and push the lever \u2014 enter and
    exit through the main door to become small size\n2. Climb the ladder and access
    the left door in the second box \u2014 open the front door to build up the buildings
    \u2014 exit and enter from the right door to become big size \u2014 push the
    buildings to right spots (according to the shapes)\n3. Congratulations on escaping!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
